    <name>Endurance (60min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 5min from 50% to 65% FTP | Steady: 9min @ 65% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 9min @ 65% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 9min @ 65% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 9min @ 65% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 9min @ 65% FTP | Steady: 1min @ 50% FTP | Cooldown: 5min from 50% to 45% FTP</description>
    <sportType>bike</sportType>
